  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands-New Zealand Education Partnership 2025-2035</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands-New Zealand Education Partnership is a bilateral education sector support programme focused on supporting the Ministry of Education and Human Resources Development&#xa0;(MEHRD) to strengthen their governance, management and leadership capability&#xa0;to provide equitable access to quality education.
Focus areas are:&#xa0;1. Operationalising provincial coordination mechanisms, 2. Building effective data systems, 3. Teacher management and welfare, and 4. Development partner coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
